# Rollout data -- run logs, candidate dumps, per-step traces -- is regenerated by
# every run, runs to tens of GB, and lives on /work2 on this host, reached through
# symlinks. None of it belongs in the repo. No trailing slashes: git sees a symlink
# as a file, which a directory pattern misses.
runs
traces
candidates
dump_candidates.json

